@startuml Manager AI Scheduling
title Sequence Diagram: Gợi ý lịch chiếu thông minh (Task 9)
skinparam theme cerulean

actor Manager
boundary "manage-showtimes.html (AI Mode)" as UI
control "SchedulingController" as Ctrl
entity "SchedulingService" as Svc
entity "BuzzAnalysisService" as BuzzSvc
entity "AnalyticsService" as AnalyticsSvc
database "Database" as DB

== Khởi tạo gợi ý lịch chiếu AI ==
Manager -> UI: Nhấn nút "Gợi ý lịch chiếu AI"
UI -> Ctrl: POST /api/scheduling/suggest (targetDate)
activate Ctrl

Ctrl -> Svc: generateAIPlan(targetDate)
activate Svc

Svc -> BuzzSvc: getExternalBuzzScores()
BuzzSvc -> BuzzSvc: Scrape News/Reviews (Simulated)
BuzzSvc --> Svc: Map<MovieId, BuzzScore>

Svc -> AnalyticsSvc: getInternalPerformance()
AnalyticsSvc -> DB: Query Revenue & Bookings
DB --> AnalyticsSvc: Stats
AnalyticsSvc --> Svc: Map<MovieId, InternalScore>

Svc -> Svc: Calculate Final Priority Score \n(Manual + Buzz + Internal)

Svc -> Svc: Run Scheduling Algorithm \n(70/30 Prime Time, Staggered Starts)

Svc --> Ctrl: List<ShowtimeDraftResponse>
deactivate Svc

Ctrl --> UI: 200 OK (Bản dự thảo lịch chiếu)
deactivate Ctrl

UI -> Manager: Hiển thị bản Preview trên Timeline
Manager -> UI: Điều chỉnh & Nhấn "Áp dụng chính thức"
UI -> Ctrl: POST /api/scheduling/apply (draftIds)
Ctrl -> DB: bulkSave(showtimes)
Ctrl --> UI: Success
@enduml
